  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proyecto de Agua y Alcantarillado Quito</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Supply  Sanitation Project Quito</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVES OF THE PROJECT ARE TO INCREASE THE COVERAGE OF POTABLE WATER AND SEWAGE SERVICES IN THE CITY OF QUITO, IMPROVE THE CONDITIONS UNDER WHICH THE SERVICES ARE BEING DELIVERED AND DEVELOP ACTIONS TO REDUCE CONTAMINATION AND PROTECT THE ENVIRONMENT IN THE CITY.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
